<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33044" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτοξεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shoot out, shoot away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βέλη ἐξετετόξευτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.214
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γραφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					9.5
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σῶφρον ἐξετόξευσεν</span>
			<i>has shot away all</i> its <i>arrows</i>, i.e. has no resource
			left, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				365
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομίζων ἐκτετοξεῦσθαι βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>reject, banish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.528
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερόριος ἐ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				252
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>shoot from</i> a place, <i>shoot arrows</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.8.14
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.1.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.486
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
